# ── LoopDeck runtime (agent subprocess) ───────────────────────────────────────
# These are injected into the spawned `claude` child process when LoopDeck runs
# an agent turn. In normal desktop use they come from the in-app Settings
# screen — the auth token is stored in the OS keychain (macOS Keychain /
# Windows Credential Manager / Secret Service); base_url / model / effort live
# in ~/.config/loopdeck/config.yaml — and DO NOT need to be set in the
# environment. They are documented here for contributors running the agent
# locally outside the GUI (e.g. for debugging).

# Anthropic-compatible auth token for the agent's model provider.
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=sk-...

# Base URL of an Anthropic-compatible endpoint. Defaults to the official
# Anthropic API; set to a compatible gateway (DeepSeek, OpenRouter, …) if
# using a third-party provider.
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com

# Default model id passed to the agent. The in-app picker overrides this.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

# ── Tests ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The ignored Rust integration tests (`cargo test -- --ignored`) spawn the
# real `claude` binary and call a live provider. Copy this file to `.env`
# and set the values below before running them. NEVER commit a real token.

# Required by integration tests in src-tauri/src/claude_session.rs.
# LOOPDECK_TEST_AUTH_TOKEN=sk-...

# Optional overrides; default to the DeepSeek endpoint shown below.
# LOOPDECK_TEST_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic
# LOOPDECK_TEST_MODEL=deepseek-v4-pro[1m]
